    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The new model of our classic floating for tuna and gt.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">22cm and 120g of weight, is the standard stick we often use, especially on single tuna or looking for gt.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Best hook setup: 4/0 or 5/0 treble in front and back or inline hooks bkk diablo 13/0 (or same weight) front and back</p>",
